      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To show a diagram inside a __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ note instead of in a note of its own, insert one with the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Mermaid diagram__TRILIUM_PH_4__ button of the __TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__Insert__TRILIUM_PH_7__ menu. It has the same views, zoom and error display as a Mermaid note, and its source stays in the text note as a code block. See __TRILIUM_PH_8__Mermaid diagram__TRILIUM_PH_9__ in __TRILIUM_PH_10__Insert buttons__TRILIUM_PH_11__.",
